# weak_spool_api.expect — the API takeoff of a craft that cannot lift ends by a ToF-silent LANDING, replies an error, and the motors stop
# 浮けない機体の API takeoff は ToF なしの LANDING で終わり、error を返し、モータは止まる
#
exit 0
log_contains any "cmd: takeoff"
log_contains any "Auto-takeoff engaged"
log_contains any "Transition: TAKEOFF → LANDING"
log_contains any "reply: error takeoff aborted"
log_contains any "Touchdown detected (the floor holds the craft up"
log_absent any "reply: error takeoff timeout"
log_absent any "Auto-takeoff aborted"
order "Auto-takeoff engaged" "Transition: TAKEOFF → LANDING"
order "Transition: TAKEOFF → LANDING" "reply: error takeoff aborted"
metric alt_max < 0.05 in 6.0 17.5
metric duty_max < 0.01 in 15.5 17.5
